msgstr "Important: File Structure Requirements"

msgid "plugins.importexport.csv.help.structure"
msgstr "Your CSV file must contain exactly the same column headers and structure as the example files. Download the example files above to see the required format. Any missing or incorrectly named columns will cause import errors."
